html:
{% set view = jifeng_production_instruction(doc) %}
{% set plan = view.plan %}
<style>
.jf-instruction-title{font-size:22px;font-weight:700}
.jf-instruction{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;table-layout:fixed}
.jf-instruction th,.jf-instruction td{padding:6px;border:1px solid #ccc;font-size:11px;vertical-align:top;overflow-wrap:anywhere}
.jf-instruction th{white-space:nowrap;background:#f5f5f5}
.jf-instruction thead{display:table-header-group}.jf-instruction tr{break-inside:avoid}
.jf-sub{font-size:10px;color:#555;margin-top:4px}.jf-qty{white-space:nowrap}.jf-note{white-space:pre-wrap}
</style>
<h2 class="jf-instruction-title">集沣生产指令单</h2>
<p>{% if 'name' in plan %}单号：{{ (plan.name or '') | e }}　{% endif %}{% if 'jf_instruction_no' in plan %}原编号：{{ (plan.jf_instruction_no or '') | e }}　{% endif %}{% if 'docstatus' in plan %}状态：{{ {0:'草稿',1:'已审核',2:'已取消'}.get(plan.docstatus, '') }}{% endif %}</p>
<p>{% if 'company' in plan %}公司：{{ (plan.company or '') | e }}　{% endif %}{% if 'posting_date' in plan %}登记日期：{{ (plan.posting_date or '') | e }}　{% endif %}{% if 'jf_instruction_date' in plan %}指令日期：{{ (plan.jf_instruction_date or '') | e }}{% endif %}</p>
<p>{% if 'jf_instruction_weight' in plan %}重量：{{ plan.jf_instruction_weight | e }}{% if 'jf_instruction_weight_uom' in plan %} {{ (plan.jf_instruction_weight_uom or '') | e }}{% endif %}　{% endif %}{% if 'jf_instruction_amount' in plan %}参考金额：{{ plan.jf_instruction_amount | e }}{% if view.currency %} {{ view.currency | e }}{% endif %}{% endif %}</p>
{% if view.item_fields %}<table class="jf-instruction"><thead><tr>{% if 'idx' in view.item_fields %}<th>序号</th>{% endif %}{% if 'jf_flow_order' in view.item_fields or 'sales_order' in view.item_fields %}<th>流程与来源</th>{% endif %}{% if 'item_code' in view.item_fields or 'bom_no' in view.item_fields %}<th>商品与 BOM</th>{% endif %}{% if 'planned_qty' in view.item_fields %}<th>计划数量</th>{% endif %}{% if 'planned_start_date' in view.item_fields %}<th>计划开工</th>{% endif %}{% if 'ordered_qty' in view.item_fields %}<th>审核工单量</th>{% endif %}{% if 'produced_qty' in view.item_fields %}<th>已生产</th>{% endif %}</tr></thead><tbody>
{% for row in view.rows %}<tr>{% if 'idx' in view.item_fields %}<td>{{ row.get('idx', '') | e }}</td>{% endif %}{% if 'jf_flow_order' in view.item_fields or 'sales_order' in view.item_fields %}<td>{% if 'jf_flow_order' in view.item_fields %}{{ (row.get('jf_flow_order') or '未关联流程单') | e }}{% endif %}{% if row.get('sales_order') %}<div class="jf-sub">销售订单：{{ row.sales_order | e }}</div>{% endif %}</td>{% endif %}{% if 'item_code' in view.item_fields or 'bom_no' in view.item_fields %}<td>{% if 'item_code' in view.item_fields %}{{ (row.get('item_code') or '') | e }}{% endif %}{% if 'bom_no' in view.item_fields %}<div class="jf-sub">BOM：{{ (row.get('bom_no') or '') | e }}</div>{% endif %}</td>{% endif %}{% if 'planned_qty' in view.item_fields %}<td class="jf-qty">{{ row.get('planned_qty', '') | e }}{% if 'stock_uom' in view.item_fields %} {{ (row.get('stock_uom') or '') | e }}{% endif %}</td>{% endif %}{% if 'planned_start_date' in view.item_fields %}<td>{{ (row.get('planned_start_date') or '') | e }}</td>{% endif %}{% if 'ordered_qty' in view.item_fields %}<td>{{ row.get('ordered_qty', '') | e }}{% if 'stock_uom' in view.item_fields %} {{ (row.get('stock_uom') or '') | e }}{% endif %}</td>{% endif %}{% if 'produced_qty' in view.item_fields %}<td>{{ row.get('produced_qty', '') | e }}{% if 'stock_uom' in view.item_fields %} {{ (row.get('stock_uom') or '') | e }}{% endif %}</td>{% endif %}</tr>{% endfor %}
</tbody></table>{% endif %}
{% if view.quantity_totals %}<p>计划数量合计：{% for unit, quantity in view.quantity_totals %}{{ quantity | e }} {{ unit | e }}{% if not loop.last %}；{% endif %}{% endfor %}</p>{% endif %}
{% if 'jf_instruction_remark' in plan %}<p class="jf-note">备注：{{ (plan.jf_instruction_remark or '') | e }}</p>{% endif %}
<p>审核工单量仅计已提交工单，已生产数量以制造入库为准。各行数量使用本行库存单位。</p>
<p>重量和参考金额用于生产指令记录。库存及财务以已提交的正式凭证为准。</p>
<p>编制：________　审核：________　接收：________</p>
